  {
    "hotel_id": "1032182",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/apa-hotel-shinagawa-sengakuji-eki-mae/hotel/tokyo-jp.html",
    "name": "APA Hotel Shinagawa Sengakuji Eki-Mae",
    "detail": "I had a couple extra days at the end of a business trip in Japan, so I flew to Tokyo. This hotel is conveniently located by the Sengakuji station with access to the Keikyu Line to/from Haneda Airport as well as the Asakusa line for access to the rest of Tokyo. I purchased the round trip Keikyu line pass and 48 hour Tokyo Metro pass at the international terminal in the airport. This was a good deal for me and it more than paid for itself. That said, I used the subway a lot. I could see it being slightly overpriced for the average user. Back to the hotel. The room was small as expected but very nice and well laid out. The air conditioner in the room was actually an air conditioner and not just a circulating unit. I was able to make the room very comfortable for sleeping (I like it on the cooler side). The hotel breakfast was nice but maybe a bit overpriced. It would have been a little less expensive if I would have booked it ahead with the room but I knew that I was only possibly going to use it one of the two mornings. I arrived late morning and checked in. I didn't expect the room to be ready. They held my luggage in a secure area while I went out sightseeing. Things like toothbrush, razor, cotton swabs available in the bathroom. Seems standard in Japan. Overall, great experience. I will keep APA in mind for future travels.",
    "area": "Shinagawa,Tokyo - View on map",
    "rating": "8.3",
    "reviews": "11509 reviews",
    "price": "115",
